+# language is one of the parsers supported by doxygen: IDL, Java, JavaScript,
+# Csharp (C#), C, C++, D, PHP, md (Markdown), Objective-C, Python, Slice, VHDL,
+# Fortran (fixed format Fortran: FortranFixed, free formatted Fortran:
